# "Waterbend {4}: Draw a card, then discard a card" (CR 701.67a-b, 121.1, 701.9). With Bot1's hand empty, the order is shown: the card drawn
# is the one discarded (discarding first would find no card and leave the Island in hand). The Leaper (4/3 Flying) is itself tapped for
# its own cost with Memnite and Ornithopter, and one Mox Sapphire mana pays the last {1}: exactly {4}, nothing else tapped. On turn 3, with
# Mox Pearl in hand and an Island drawn, Bot1 chooses which to discard: it keeps the Island.

